{"seq":2,"slug":"structuring-a-monorepo-for-agents","title":"Structuring A Monorepo For Agents","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/structuring-a-monorepo-for-agents","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"workspaces-and-package-layout","title":"Workspace 与包布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/structuring-a-monorepo-for-agents/workspaces-and-package-layout","wordCount":1582,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"dependency-graph-and-boundaries","title":"依赖图与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/structuring-a-monorepo-for-agents/dependency-graph-and-boundaries","wordCount":1635,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"shared-code-and-internal-packages","title":"共享代码与内部包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/structuring-a-monorepo-for-agents/shared-code-and-internal-packages","wordCount":1729,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章讲怎么组织 monorepo 的结构让 agent 易理解、易导航:用清晰的 workspace 与包布局(apps/、packages/ 等),让 agent 知道仓库里有哪些包、各是什么;用清晰、单向、无环的依赖图与包边界,让 agent 能推理&quot;改一个包影响哪些包&quot;;以及用规范的共享代码与内部包,让跨包复用有序、边界明确——结构清晰的 monorepo 让 agent 把&quot;一个大仓库&quot;理解成&quot;一组有边界的包&quot;。</p>\n"}